# PwC GenAI Shared Services API Reference

When working on AI service code, model configuration, or API proxy logic, read `docs/PWC_GENAI_API_REFERENCE.md` for verified details on:

- Available models (168 across Azure, OpenAI, Vertex AI, Bedrock)
- Endpoint compatibility (Chat Completions vs Responses API)
- Web search behavior and citation format
- Model role recommendations for Edwin's task pipeline
- Provider prefix mapping (`azure.*`, `openai.*`, `vertex_ai.*`, `bedrock.*`)
- Key constraints (e.g., Responses API only works with `openai.*` models)

The reference was tested and verified on 2026-03-31 with API key from `backend/.env`.
